target/
*.png
# Most of docs/images/ was internal development screenshots, several of
# which turned out to carry the real developer's signed-in name and email
# (found during v0.1 prep); untracked wholesale rather than hand-checking
# all of them. Only the README's own screenshots, captured fresh from an
# isolated BAAZ_STATE_DIR with --replay, are tracked.
!docs/images/readme-*.png
!assets/icon-*.png
# The Baaz mascot art: bundled PNGs served by `crate::mascot` (else `*.png`
# above would leave the copies untracked; the directory alone is not enough,
# the files themselves must be re-included).
!/crates/baaz/assets/mascot/**/*.png
.DS_Store
__pycache__/
# Local secrets for testing (owner-provided API key); never committed.
.dev.env
.env
# A local `[patch]` pointing the aui crates at a checkout beside this one
# (CONTRIBUTING.md). Personal to a working copy; never committed.
/.cargo/config.toml

# Internal AI-process material: not part of the public v0.1 release. Kept on
# disk for whoever maintains this checkout, just not tracked.
/CLAUDE.md
/docs/briefs/
/docs/diagnosis/
/docs/audit/
/docs/mockups/
/docs/status/
/docs/05-handoff.md
/docs/09-handoff-improvements.md
/docs/11-muse-workflows.md
/docs/13-*
/docs/14-*
/docs/15-*
# The old phase-by-phase internal diary; superseded by the root CHANGELOG.md.
/docs/CHANGELOG.md
